  "details": "Local Test Builds are kinda weird in the Beta right now, you can't decide which region to use for them and If I create a local Test Build the in game menu will show it as a US instance (EU would be the best for my location) but my ping is as high as in a EU instance. So it is either using the wrong region or showing the wrong region in the menu. This is kinda confusing if you want to test the networking stuff in your world. That should be fixed.\n\nIn addition I would maybe recommend to maybe add buttons in the sdk to select the which region you want to use. The picture is just how I could imagine it looking in the sdk. It's not that important but it would be nice to have.",
